新川 尚士","creatorId":"vndb:s22658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22658","name":"新川 尚士","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:56031","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"すかぢ","creatorId":"vndb:s208","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s208","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s208","name":"SCA-自","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:56034","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12294","characterName":"湯川 涼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12294"},"originalCharacterName":"湯川 涼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chouji's and Eika's cousin who is currently living with them. She's a very superstitious person. Ryou is also recognized as a school idol like Chouji as she's not only beautiful but also possesses the strength to eliminate most of the delinquents around the school. Thus, other students believe that Ryou and Tane have a rivalry kind of relationship between them (as in honor student versus a delinquent). Other than that, she's Chouji's classmate and a vice president of the Student Council at their school."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Some time ago during their childhoods, she was engaged to be married to Chouji by her grandfather."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12294"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8d282c8a528baa6fad409ea924a0e8b6effb780929f1a5567d2d0c8b0b2a7055.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f43c9eff7de71da1209859a0d089d8c348d4810bf73a08a8b1d97e6f8d6fba6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"楠 鈴音","creatorId":"vndb:s112","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s112","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s112","name":"鳴海 エリカ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31077","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12295","characterName":"柳瀬 重耳","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12295"},"originalCharacterName":"柳瀬 重耳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only male in the Yanagise residence. One could say that this charismatic school council president is a very lucky man considering that he lives alongside four beautiful girls, all of them just waiting for a little bit of attention from him. It could be said that he almost achieved one of the most desired fantasies of all healthy males alike - that he has built his own personal harem. High-spirited Tane, bitter smiling Eika, cold gazing Ryou and a relatively new resident in the house Tsumugu... how did Chouji’s seemingly normal life suddenly become like the Palace of Versailles? Many enquiring minds would like to know."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12295"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50a550d00e090b9562083b6ccf541ca2d8ab91e112897277bf2671b55641fd29.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e59b3eb109c99b5345fe7bb5a3c0795eb7bb94a54fe1b6c6a29b9573d104d618.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12296","characterName":"柳瀬 詠歌","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12296"},"originalCharacterName":"柳瀬 詠歌","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chouji's younger sister who often teases and verbally abuses him, along with their cousin Ryou. In school, she is known as a gentle, academically-achieving, athletic wonder. But in reality, there's more to her than meets the eye."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She's madly in love with her older brother even to the point of always masturbating while thinking of him no matter the place whether is it at home, school, public toilet, etc. Her abnormally high sexual desire for Chouji is permanently affecting her life so at one point she'll try to get rid of her 'Nii-san addiction'. Needless to say, a lewd brocon like her can't really accomplish such a feat so her attempt at doing that will instead lead to a disaster of epic proportions."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12296"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/efd0b4f097fd682ff8d742ff166b2b39086f0de1221669c75d5d3f957aae156f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/556b62cea7b32c9cc0627348bd1221543580667b3f6b4a3aa3b8ae2c35fe580f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉 結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31079","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12297","characterName":"鬼ヶ瀬 胤","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12297"},"originalCharacterName":"鬼ヶ瀬 胤","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A strong (her fists can produce shockwaves) but sweet, kind girl who lives in Chouji's shoe closet. Because of her hair color and abnormal strength she's mistaken for a delinquent by all students except Chouji and other 3 main heroines. Her infamy of being a badass delinquent landed her a couple of (almost) nameless followers like Delinquent A and Delinquent B. Nevertheless, Tane is dedicated only to Chouji, who seems to be the only person out there who's able to recognize her in any costume she wears."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Tane's real surname is 'Sanjouin'. The real 'Onigase' is actually Chouji (it's an abbreviation of his nickname from childhood - 'Oni no Yanagise'). They met each other during their childhoods when he drove off some bullies that were harassing Tane because of her hair color. 'Onigase' taught Tane self-defense and they parted after he staged a fight to bestow his title upon her. After some time, they reunited again with each other in high school."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12297"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c47c44ab99f50120366ffe6b33c2a5174eb863c6ce1ffd7045a10fd156c4206e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/7032b8236ebbf6d6027d4e5ba46061001fc08a0fb7bc04755fcd202a625e1a52.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"如月 葵","creatorId":"vndb:s757","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s757","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s757","name":"吉田 愛理","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31080","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12298","characterName":"養老 紡","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12298"},"originalCharacterName":"養老 紡","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"136"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The janitor of Chouji's school. She always wears her maid outfit, and often carries around her customized broom (as in customized to be a real lethal gun weapon) with her. She was known to always wear her poker face and never let out a single emotion before,"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"but one day, Chouji helped her when she injured her leg, and then he offered her to move in and start living in his house"},{"spoiler":false,"text":". Now, she's staying in a dog house in Chouji's garden rather than living at school where she used to live before."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her personality became warmer and more outgoing ever since she started living there. She never completed her schooling due to her circumstances and therefore can be found sitting outside of classrooms listening in on the lectures often."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12298"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0eb8c53f92d0fb801e40b738ac122452819bb9120b80d04b34c039baf61978da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c858d675a7a1955dcd79324c83c8b78bb5da988f331df95dcff6498ed902a256.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かわしま りの","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31076","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c22794","characterName":"恋桜 可憐","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c22794"},"originalCharacterName":"恋桜 可憐","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descrip